# Parity: the old man in Ur who wants a Potion (cast 22: flag branches, the item menu, checkUseItem). Tools\parity.ps1 -Map t01_01 -Drive Docs\Drives\parity-ur-elder.drive -Pos -40,0,138 -Rot 0
wait 3
flag 0:11 on
wait 1
say before
press Z 150
wait 3
say talking
press Z 150
wait 3
say menu
press X 150
wait 3
say closed
press Z 150
wait 2
say again
quit
